<title>UK: FHFB prices $500 million three-year global bond.</title>
<headline>FHFB prices $500 million three-year global bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Morgan Stanley on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOUSING FINANCE BOARD</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.00	MATURITY   *17.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 SPREAD	+31 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS UK/FR/DE/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.025     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.NOV.99  NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 17.DEC.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
